1. Identity, Access & Tenant Isolation

(Focus: Authentication, RBAC, Secret Isolation)

Entra ID Group Mapping

* One-to-one mapping between Entra ID groups and Databricks teams/workspaces
* Standardized naming convention for groups
* SCIM-based automated group synchronization

RBAC & Workspace Permissions

* Role-based access model for:
    * Admins
    * Developers
    * Analysts
    * Service Principals
* Least-privilege enforcement

Secret & Credential Isolation

* Dedicated Azure Key Vault-backed secret scopes per tenant/team
* Prevent cross-team secret visibility
* Restrict secret scope management to platform admins

Service Principal Governance

* Dedicated SPNs per application/team where required
* PAT usage restrictions and lifecycle management
* Managed Identity strategy clarification

Open Questions

* Will access provisioning be fully automated via IaC/SCIM?
* Are platform admins centralized or delegated per team?
* Will break-glass admin accounts exist?

